### Z2 — later-arg / same-arg after inner RPAREN (**FAIL**)
ELF walker after optional one `LPAREN`:

```
while in_args:
    if RPAREN → stop          # no depth
    if IDENT  → refuse resolved
    else      → p+1
```

`println((n), tok)` tokens after the skipped `LPAREN`:
`LPAREN INT RPAREN COMMA IDENT tok RPAREN`. First `RPAREN` ends the
walk. `tok` is never seen. Same for `println(id(1), tok)`.

| # | Shape | emit-c | check | emit-llvm | emit-wasm | FN? |
|---|-------|--------|-------|-----------|-----------|-----|
| 06 | `println((n), tok)` | rc=1 `SECRET tok` after `oo_print_int((n));` | **OK** rc=0 | rc=0 `@oo_print_int` only; `@.str.0 = "s3cret"` | rc=0 `local.get $tok` **drop** | **yes** check/llvm/wasm |
| 07 | `println(id(1), tok)` | rc=1 `SECRET tok` after `oo_print_int(id(1LL));` | **OK** | rc=0 first-arg int; `c"s3cret"` in module | rc=0 drop tok | **yes** |
| 08 | `eprintln(id(1), tok)` | rc=1 `SECRET tok` (emit-guard) | **OK** | rc=0 first-arg int | — | **yes** |
| 22 | `println((1), a, b)` two SECRETs | rc=1 `SECRET a` after `oo_print_int((1LL));` | **OK** | rc=0 print `1` only | — | **yes** |
| dbl | `println(((n)), tok)` | rc=1 `SECRET tok` | **OK** | rc=0 first-arg + `c"s3cret"` | — | **yes** |
| empty | `println(g(), tok)` | rc=1 `SECRET tok` after `oo_print_int(g());` | **OK** | rc=0 first-arg | rc=0 drop tok | **yes** |
| e-empty | `eprintln(g(), tok)` | rc=1 (guard) | **OK** | rc=0 first-arg | — | **yes** |

Exact bytes (06, dual-repro):

- emit-c: `oo_print_int((n));` then `ERR\tsecret\tprintln sink refuses SECRET tok\n` (rc=1)
- check: `OK\n` (rc=0)
- llvm: `call void @oo_print_int(i64 %t1)` + `c"s3cret\00"` in the module
- wasm: `call $println_str` then `local.get $tok` / `drop`
- bc: `LOAD_LOCAL 0` / `LOAD_LOCAL 1` / `CALL println 2` (rc=0)

Same-arg after inner `RPAREN` (wave-1 peer2 class; **re-proved**):

| # | Shape | emit-c | check | emit-llvm | FN? |
|---|-------|--------|-------|-----------|-----|
| p+ | `println(("x") + tok)` | rc=0 **LEAK** `oo_print_str(oo_str_concat((oo_str_lit("x")), tok))` | **OK** | rc=0 `@oo_print_str` of concat; `c"s\00"` | **yes + leak** |
| e+ | `eprintln(("x") + tok)` | rc=1 `SECRET tok` (guard) | **OK** | rc=0 `@oo_print_str` of concat | **yes** check/llvm |
| pi | `println(((1) + tok))` | rc=0 **LEAK** `oo_print_int((((1LL) + tok)))` | **TYPE** arity (no `ERR secret`) | rc=0 `@oo_print_int` of sum | **yes** emit-c/llvm |
| ei | `eprintln(((1) + tok))` | rc=1 (guard) | **OK** | rc=0 `@oo_print_int` | **yes** check/llvm |
| pn | `println(f(g(), tok))` | rc=0 **LEAK** `oo_print_str(f(g(), tok))` | **OK** | rc=0 `@oo_print_str` of call | **yes + leak** |
